 B &= 10 * 28 && \text{(business articles)}
 \end{align*}

 Solving the equations simultaneously, we find:
 \begin{align*}
 P &= 560 \\
 W &= 888 \\
 B &= 2240 \\
 T &= P + W + B = 3788
 \end{align*}

 Thus, the two websites published a combined total of \boxed{3788} articles in February.

